{# The two columns of every page of the frame (`page_frame.html.j2`, 0333): the left column, its
   list above (scrolled on its own) and the ⌨ keyboard panel below (`keys.css.j2`), always
   visible in the same place; the panel showing what the decisions file holds for what is on
   screen. Under 900 px, the left column goes under the content. #}
{% include "keys.css.j2" %}
  .layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(240px, 340px) 1fr; align-items: start; }
  main { padding: 12px 16px 24px; }
  /* No header above the columns (the bar is the right column's): the left one stays at the top
     of the window, short enough to show its keys whole under the page's header (44 px) on a
     page too short to scroll. */
  #side { position: sticky; top: 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;
          height: calc(100vh - 60px); margin: 8px 0 8px 16px; }
  #toc { flex: 1; min-height: 0; overflow: auto; padding: 10px 12px; background: var(--card);
         border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; font-size: .85rem; }
  #toc h2 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  #disk { margin-top: 14px; padding: 8px 12px; background: var(--card);
          border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; font-size: .85rem; }
  #disk > summary { font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    #side { order: 2; position: static; height: auto; margin: 0 16px 16px; }
  }
